---
title: "What Happens After You Apply for a Mortgage?"
description: "The real sequence from first conversation to closing day: pre-approval, shopping, conditions, lawyer, and closing — with realistic timing for each step."
canonicalPath: "/what-happens-next/"
ogSlug: "what-happens-next"
layout: layouts/base.njk
intent: medium
---
{# JOB: lay out the real sequence from application to closing, then offer one softer next step — medium intent, no hard ask up front. #}
<div class="container-narrow" style="padding-top:var(--space-6);padding-bottom:var(--space-8)">
  <a class="back-link" href="/">← All calculators</a>
  <h1 style="margin:var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-3);font-size:var(--text-28);letter-spacing:var(--track-28)">What happens after you apply?</h1>
  <p style="font-size:var(--text-15);opacity:.75;max-width:60ch;margin:0 0 var(--space-6)">The actual sequence, start to finish.</p>

  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;border-top:2px solid var(--color-divider)">
    {% for step in copy.PROCESS_STEPS %}
    <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--space-4);padding:var(--space-4) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-divider);align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div class="how-n" style="margin-top:2px">{{ loop.index }}</div>
      <div style="flex:1 1 240px">
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:800;font-size:var(--text-17);letter-spacing:var(--track-17);margin-bottom:4px">{{ step.title }}</div>
        <p style="font-size:var(--text-15);opacity:.75;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 4px">{{ step.blurb }}</p>
        <div style="font-size:var(--text-13);opacity:.7">{{ step.timing }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
    {{ contactCardHtml({
      id: 'process',
      calculatorName: 'What happens next',
      intro: "Every file is a little different. A licensed mortgage agent can walk you through what this timeline looks like for your specific situation."
    }) | safe }}
  </div>

  <div class="next-links" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
    <a href="/mortgage-affordability-calculator/" class="next-link">See what you can afford →</a>
    <a href="/what-youll-need/" class="next-link">See what documents you'll need →</a>
  </div>
</div>
